NOTE ON USE

This software processes live telephone call audio and is intended for use in
outbound sales calling. Recording and transcription of phone calls is
regulated, and in roughly a dozen US states recording without all parties'
consent is a crime rather than a policy violation. Telephone solicitation is
additionally regulated under the TCPA and, for insurance, under state
insurance law.

This software is not a compliance system. See docs/06-COMPLIANCE.md before
deploying it on live calls, and have your own counsel review your recording
disclosure and do-not-call process.
